  "releaseNotes": "Adds the ESF405 build check (Eternet/Devs.Issues#2481): in a service that Service Fabric deploys with 2 or -1 instances, read from the application's own manifests and parameter files, every hosted service and Hangfire recurring job must be marked [RunsOnceAcrossReplicas] or [RunsOnEveryReplica] (both attributes in Eternet.AspNetCore.ServiceFabric.Replicas). EternetReplicaCheck=true/false forces it.",
